<title>CHILE: CHILE TELECOM UNDERSECRETARY SAN MARTIN RESIGNS.</title>
<headline>CHILE TELECOM UNDERSECRETARY SAN MARTIN RESIGNS.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chilean Telecommunications Undersecretary Gregorio San Martin has resigned, said an official at the transport and telecommunications ministry.</p>
<p>His resignation followed media reports Thursday of alleged irregularities in the recent awarding of concessions to operate wireless PCS telephone services.</p>
<p>San Martin was in charge of the regulation of Chile's deregulated, highly competitive telecom market.</p>
<p>((-- Margaret Orgill, Santiago newsroom, 562-699-5595x212))</p>
